rthern Ireland.\n* Fertifa's founders are Tony Chen and Nick Kuan, while Eileen Burbidge is the executive director.\n\nP.P.S. The Observer values reader feedback and encourages continued engagement to maintain accuracy in its reporting.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Section", "logprob": -0.00029523781267926097}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.3871017396450043}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.06963561475276947}, {"token": "▁Guardian", "logprob": -0.004162339493632317}, {"token": "▁newspaper", "logprob": -0.7657176852226257}, {"token": "▁has", "logprob": -0.029507964849472046}, {"token": "▁issued", "logprob": -0.029771361500024796}, {"token": "▁corrections", "logprob": -0.5348689556121826}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.010831963270902634}, {"token": "▁several", "logprob": -0.00016973962192423642}, {"token": "▁articles", "logprob": -0.047449082136154175}, {"token": "▁published", "logprob": -2.169585604860913e-05}, {"token": "▁on", "logprob": -0.0005619138828478754}, {"token": "▁August", "logprob": -0.00010585224663373083}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "5", "logprob": -3.3378546504536644e-06}, {"token": "th", "logprob": -1.9073468138230965e-06}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.012372762896120548}, {"token": "▁These", "logprob": -0.010674403049051762}, {"token": "▁corrections", "logprob": -0.12800665199756622}, {"token": "▁address", "logprob": -0.20421068370342255}, {"token": "▁inaccuracies", "logprob": -0.22064687311649323}, {"token": "▁related", "logprob": -1.8997986316680908}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁pet", "logprob": -1.6782371997833252}, {"token": "▁theft", "logprob": -0.000219321038457565}, {"token": "▁legislation", "logprob": -0.007796925958245993}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.002968074521049857}, {"token": "▁company", "logprob": -0.25914138555526733}, {"token": "▁leadership", "logprob": -0.6750900149345398}, {"to